{"ID":"20240515131417-s8r6jcn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131417-s8r6jcn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131417-s8r6jcn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140255-ouzckev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140255-ouzckev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140255-ouzckev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:260,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:260\u0026#125;","title":"054","type":"doc","updated":"20240515161650"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140255-ouzckev","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1014px;","id":"20240515140255-ouzckev","updated":"20240515161650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HY"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後肩痛，後腰痛在帶脈。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙乳有硬塊，兩個月前發現。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡不好，每日2：15am必醒，可再入睡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便三天一行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經很準時。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肚子肥大，有時排氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷，睡時身冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經常身體冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經前右乳有一硬塊會痛（位於足少陰經上）。再約兩週後月經將至。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃乾。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梁丘、上巨虛、解谿、太衝、後谿、申脈、足臨泣、外關（以上雙側），左然谷。梁丘為胃經郄穴，可治療經脈上不論虛實的痛症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上巨虛：治臍上氣實之病，令其虛之。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解谿：同時打開經脈中阻塞之氣，猶如河川疏浚使之流暢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太衝：再引大水由高處往下衝，加速水道（經脈）之順暢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後谿配申脈：針對項肩強痛的治療。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"足臨泣配外關：治療腰痛。外關尚可治療三焦、陽維之病。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然谷：腎經，因為要導引水出（腰痛因濕重引起），水在深層，故要深刺至骨邊。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 黃芩三錢 龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子四錢 桂枝三錢 白芍三錢 炙甘草三錢 當歸二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木通三錢 細辛二錢 大黃二錢 牡蠣一兩"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五帖，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患原先就診原因是肩痛與腰痛，但後來又提及乳房有硬塊，倪師認為肩痛與腰痛以針刺治療即可痊癒，乳房硬塊則需服藥治療。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患月經週期雖然正常，但經前乳脹時會有一小區域特別痛，此即奶水堆積之患部。本次處方先以柴胡、玉金、黃芩、龍膽草針對睡不好，每日2：15am必醒的症狀治療；當歸四逆湯加大黃治療雙足冷、睡時身冷及便秘；牡蠣軟堅。同時病人雖有寒證，但因未到用生附子的程度，故用炮附子，且炮附味鹹還能軟堅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至於用四物湯加炒麥芽治療乳房硬塊的方法，則在月經來之前再開始服，屆時利用奶水下行的自然生理變化時機用藥，效果更好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}